  "description": "Slidize.Plugins is a lightweight .NET library for managing presentations and converting them to PowerPoint, OpenDocument, and image formats. With its unique licensing system, you can plug in and purchase only the functionality you need. It supports advanced image processing, customizable presentation formats, merging presentations, and controlling notes, comments, and hidden slides. The library also offers PDF compliance control and multi-page TIFF exports, making it ideal for batch conversions and complex workflows.",
